{"id":"cf4fb7b3eb8fd5af","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-value-atomic.md","title":"ZFC Forcing3 Boolean Value Atomic","display":"df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-value-atomic — ZFC Forcing3 Boolean Value Atomic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-value-atomic","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-value-atomic"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-value-atomic — ZFC Forcing3 Boolean Value Atomic","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing10-boolean-truth-value]]","[[58-df-name]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-value-atomic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-value-atomic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-value-atomic — ZFC Forcing3 Boolean Value Atomic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b317b32e88081cdf\" href=\"?note=b317b32e88081cdf\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra\">58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b153b750ecf2b78b\" href=\"?note=b153b750ecf2b78b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing10-boolean-truth-value\">58-df-zfc-forcing10-boolean-truth-value</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10BooleanTruthValue}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10BooleanTruthValue}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3BooleanValueAtomic}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3BooleanValueAtomic}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B},\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathbb B},o,\\dot x,\\dot y,b\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B},\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathbb B},o,\\dot x,\\dot y,b\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\\in\\{\\mathtt{mem},\\mathtt{eq}\\}\">\\(o\\in\\{\\mathtt{mem},\\mathtt{eq}\\}\\)</span> (tag selecting the atomic formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b317b32e88081cdf\" href=\"?note=b317b32e88081cdf\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra\">58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10BooleanTruthValue}_S(\\mathbb B,\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathbb B})\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10BooleanTruthValue}_S(\\mathbb B,\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathbb B})\\)</span> is the registered Boolean-valuation predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,\\mathbb B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,\\mathbb B)\\)</span> is the registered set predicate for a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B\">\\(\\mathbb B\\)</span>-name</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3BooleanValueAtomic}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3BooleanValueAtomic}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}value\\text{-}atomic} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3BooleanValueAtomic}_S(\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B},\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathbb B},o,\\dot x,\\dot y,b)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10BooleanTruthValue}_S(\\mathbb B,\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathbb B})\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,\\mathbb B)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot y,\\mathbb B)\\land b\\in\\mathbb B\\land\\bigl((o=\\mathtt{mem}\\land b=\\|\\dot x\\in\\dot y\\|_{\\mathbb B})\\lor(o=\\mathtt{eq}\\land b=\\|\\dot x=\\dot y\\|_{\\mathbb B})\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}value\\text{-}atomic} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3BooleanValueAtomic}_S(\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B},\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathbb B},o,\\dot x,\\dot y,b)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10BooleanTruthValue}_S(\\mathbb B,\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathbb B})\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,\\mathbb B)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot y,\\mathbb B)\\land b\\in\\mathbb B\\land\\bigl((o=\\mathtt{mem}\\land b=\\|\\dot x\\in\\dot y\\|_{\\mathbb B})\\lor(o=\\mathtt{eq}\\land b=\\|\\dot x=\\dot y\\|_{\\mathbb B})\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The operation tag removes the former ambiguity between membership and equality Boolean values; names are now checked by the registered two-place predicate rather than membership in the proper-class expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^{\\mathbb B}\">\\(V^{\\mathbb B}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","leve